member.summary:
Gets or sets if turn on/off "dry-run" mode of the interaction.
True to turn on dry-run mode. False to turn off dry-run mode.

If dry-run mode, datapoint enter and save change will
  1. Not break signature;
  2. Not fire status rollup (not set dirty);
  3. Not save the datapoint value change to the database.

