This method was added for the following scenario (DT 12848)
1. User enters Rave into eLearning home page because there is a course for a study;
2. Navigates to User details page for the same user account;
3. Changes role for a study from eLearning to no-eLearning;
4. Goes to Rave home page;
5. Goes back to User details page for the same user account and changes role for the same study from no-eLearning to eLearning.
6. Now the user can deeplink without completing the course.
This method prevents step 6 from happening

Removed cleared study from the session

